      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>AF has failed to focus successfully and has locked focus.</para>
          <para>This state is reached only after an explicit START AF trigger has been sent (android.control.afTrigger), when good focus cannot be obtained.</para>
          <para>The lens will remain stationary until the AF mode (android.control.afMode) is changed or a new AF trigger is sent to the camera device (android.control.afTrigger).</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/hardware/camera2/CameraMetadata#CONTROL_AF_STATE_NOT_FOCUSED_LOCKED" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.hardware.camera2.CameraMetadata.CONTROL_AF_STATE_NOT_FOCUSED_LOCKED</code>.</a></format></para>
